{"id":78,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Fiery mane aglow, Rapidash darts like an arrow across the land. This prodigiously swift creature can traverse the vast region of Hisui in a day and a half."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The fastest runner becomes the leader, and it decides the herd’s pace and direction of travel."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon can be seen galloping through fields at speeds of up to 150 mph, its fiery mane fluttering in the wind."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Just loves to run. If it sees something faster than itself, it will give chase at top speed."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Rapidash usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this Pokémon turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"games":["Y","Diamond"],"text":"It gallops at nearly 150 mph. With its mane blazing ferociously, it races as if it were an arrow."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Very competitive, this Pokémon will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance."},{"games":["SoulSilver"],"text":"With incredible acceleration, it reaches its top speed of 150 mph after running just 10 steps."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"At full gallop, its four hooves barely touch the ground because it moves so incredibly fast."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It has astounding acceleration. From a standstill, it can reach top speed within 10 steps."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It can gallop at a top speed of 150 miles per hour. It can race as fast as a bullet train while ablaze."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It usually canters casually in the fields and plains. But once a RAPIDASH turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It just loves to gallop. The faster it goes, the longer the swaying flames of its mane will become."},{"games":["Silver"],"text":"With incredible acceleration, it reaches its top speed of 150 mph after running just ten steps."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":true,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":77,"name":"Ponyta","condition":null,"children":[{"id":78,"name":"Rapidash","condition":"Lv. 40","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[0,684],[1,33],[1,39],[1,45],[1,52],[1,98],[1,224],[1,398],[15,488],[20,97],[25,172],[30,23],[35,83],[43,36],[49,517],[56,126],[63,394]],"machine":[97,502,213,226,34,340,204,529,203,263,126,83,53,394,416,257,667,63,231,67,224,595,315,6,583,398,182,156,496,214,684,173,76,669,164,241,129,14,675,528,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[815]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-189","name":"Rapidash","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"189","artist":null,"img":"sv10/189"},{"id":"sv10-30","name":"Rapidash","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"30","artist":null,"img":"sv10/30"},{"id":"sv7-20","name":"Rapidash","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"20","artist":null,"img":"sv7/20"},{"id":"sv5-27","name":"Rapidash","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"27","artist":"Ryota Murayama","img":"sv5/27"},{"id":"sv3pt5-78","name":"Rapidash","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity